'''The Queen & The Dead''' (女帝と亡者, ''Nyotei to Mōja'', '''Empress and the Dead''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 3 Legend [[Catseye]]s as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[Honey Trap (Deadly)|Honey Trap]] and [[Parade of the Dead (Deadly)|Parade of the Dead]] respectively. To unlock The Queen & The Dead, you must clear both Queen's Coronation and Dead on Debut.

